  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Proposed ground & first floor rear extensions, internal alterations,  porch extension, approved loft dormer and all associated works at 118 Headstone Drive, HA1 4UH",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed two storey rear extension and rear dormer in conjunction with the gabled roof form of the original dwelling house, by reason of their excessive combined bulk and massing, would form an incongruous, discordant, unduly bulky and dominant addition to the host dwelling and street scene which would fail to respect the prevailing character of the locality, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3.D(1) and D3.D(11-12) of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 the Harrow Local Plan (2021 - 2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
